tools.description:
Delete category

Delete a category. Requires category write access.

DELETE /api/tournaments/tab/tourns/{tournId}/categories/{categoryId}

Delete one synced coach material

Cascades to every synced version snapshot of this material too.

DELETE /api/coach-materials/{materialId}

Delete room

Delete a room. Requires tournament write access.

DELETE /api/tournaments/tab/tourns/{tournId}/sites/{siteId}/rooms/{roomId}

Delete school

Deletes a school within the specified tournament. Requires tournament write access.

DELETE /api/tournaments/tab/tourns/{tournId}/schools/{schoolId}

Delete site

Delete a site. Requires tournament write access.

DELETE /api/tournaments/tab/tourns/{tournId}/sites/{siteId}

Delete timeslot

Deletes the timeslot with the given ID. Requires timeslot write access.

DELETE /api/tournaments/tab/tourns/{tournId}/timeslots/{timeslotId}

Get category by ID

Retrieve a category by its ID. Requires category read access.

GET /api/tournaments/tab/tourns/{tournId}/categories/{categoryId}

Get circuit by ID

Gets a circuit by ID.

GET /api/tournaments/rest/circuits/{circuitId}

Get event and round list by abbreviation

Returns Event object with list of published rounds given an event abbreviation. Only available when HIDE_DEV_ENDPOINTS is false.

GET /api/tournaments/rest/tourns/{tournId}/events/byAbbr/{eventAbbr}

Get paradigm details by person ID

Retrieve paradigm details for a specific person ID. Requires authentication.

GET /api/tournaments/rest/paradigms/{personId}

Get protocol tiebreaks for round (dev endpoint)

Get tiebreaks needed for a protocol id. For testing and dev only.

GET /api/tournaments/pages/protocol/round/{roundId}

Get published round by ID

Returns a single Round object by ID if it is published.

GET /api/tournaments/rest/tourns/{tournId}/rounds/{roundId}

Get public result set by ID

Returns result set with full display information given a result set ID if it is public.

GET /api/tournaments/rest/tourns/{tournId}/results/{resultSetId}

Get room by ID

Retrieve a room by its ID. Requires tournament read access.

GET /api/tournaments/tab/tourns/{tournId}/sites/{siteId}/rooms/{roomId}

Get round schematic

Gives data for the display of a public round schematic.

GET /api/tournaments/pages/invite/{tournId}/{eventAbbr}/{roundName}

Get school by ID

Retrieves a school by its ID within the specified tournament. Requires tournament read access.

GET /api/tournaments/tab/tourns/{tournId}/schools/{schoolId}

Get site by ID

Retrieve a site by its ID. Requires tournament read access.

GET /api/tournaments/tab/tourns/{tournId}/sites/{siteId}

Get tiebreaks for round (dev endpoint)

Get tiebreaks needed for a protocol id. For testing and dev only.

GET /api/tournaments/pages/tiebreaks/{roundId}

Get timeslot by ID

Returns a timeslot object for the given ID. Requires timeslot read access.

GET /api/tournaments/tab/tourns/{tournId}/timeslots/{timeslotId}

Get tournament ID by webname

Retrieve the tournament ID and details by webname (or tournament ID).

GET /api/tournaments/pages/invite/webname/{webname}

Get public tournament by ID

Retrieve public information about a specific tournament.

GET /api/tournaments/rest/tourns/{tournId}

Update category

Update a category. Requires category write access.

PUT /api/tournaments/tab/tourns/{tournId}/categories/{categoryId}

Update room

Update a room. Requires tournament write access.

PUT /api/tournaments/tab/tourns/{tournId}/sites/{siteId}/rooms/{roomId}

Update school

Updates an existing school within the specified tournament. Requires tournament write access.

PUT /api/tournaments/tab/tourns/{tournId}/schools/{schoolId}

Update site

Update a site. Requires tournament write access.

PUT /api/tournaments/tab/tourns/{tournId}/sites/{siteId}

Update timeslot

Updates the timeslot with the given ID. Requires timeslot write access.

PUT /api/tournaments/tab/tourns/{tournId}/timeslots/{timeslotId}
